@Comment{
  Keep research commentary out of printable bibliography fields such as note.
  Record the DOI of every paper that has one, including arXiv DOIs for preprints.
  Give papers no url; keep url only for web resources such as documentation.
  Name proceedings "Proc. <edition> <sponsor> <name> (<acronym>)" and abbreviate International,
  Conference, Symposium, Software and Engineering as the IEEE reference guide does (Int., Conf.,
  Symp., Softw., Eng.), without "on" and "of the" after them, because the paper needs the room.
  The year takes the place of the edition only when a series numbers no editions.
}

